  "review": "The historical miniature clears the nominal PMTiles footway by 0.29 m. The dated lower terrace grade exposes the garden, pool and court and supports the front plinth. The stock paths retain their geometry and the largest sampled paving height change is about 2 cm. Terrain grids coarser than about 1 m may omit the local grade and partly cover the lower garden.",
  "limitations": [
    "The model represents the display photographed in the 2003 archive, the panorama published in 2012 and the 2022 flyover. Present condition is unverified.",
    "The façade height ratio is fitted to the archived camera. Absolute dimensions, rear openings, roof fixtures and terrace depths remain photographic estimates.",
    "The garden-facing bearing and miniature scale come from the archived exhibit photographs and panorama. A one-metre east adjustment within the photographed planting island yields an approximate site fit over the retained PMTiles footways. The reconstruction appears on the snapshot date. The original platform coordinates and current display condition remain unresolved.",
    "The historical miniature clears the nominal PMTiles footway by 0.29 m. The dated lower terrace grade exposes the garden, pool and court and supports the front plinth. The stock paths retain their geometry and the largest sampled paving height change is about 2 cm. Terrain grids coarser than about 1 m may omit the local grade and partly cover the lower garden."
